49	#tr.en: Pure are the cities -- and you are the ones to whom they are allotted. Pure is @wGN{Dilmun} land.
53	#tr.en: Pure is @wGN{Sumer} -- and you are the ones to whom it is allotted. Pure is @wGN{Dilmun} land.
57	#tr.en: Pure is @wGN{Dilmun} land. Virginal is @wGN{Dilmun} land.
61	#tr.en: Virginal is @wGN{Dilmun} land. Pristine is @wGN{Dilmun} land.
